direction: right
phone: ChatGPT mobile
relay: Secure relay
machine: Your machine running Codex
sandbox: Workspace sandbox
tests: Tests and in-app browser
diff: Diff and screenshots
phone -> relay: approve or steer
relay -> machine: no public exposure
machine -> sandbox: run task
sandbox -> tests: verify
tests -> diff: result
diff -> relay: live state
relay -> phone: updates in real time
